Slice em up like butter using your Katana**\n\n{1789859202221739}\n\n**Are you into explosions? Use the Canon! Pretty sure it was stolen from a museum** \n{1799911087780149}\n\n# FEATURES\n- Your room is the arena: zombies use your walls, floor, doors and furniture\n- Grab a shotgun from your left shoulder and a sword from your right\n- Feed shells into the shotgun by hand\n- Place a cannon on your floor, aim the barrel, wait out the 5-second fuse and blow the horde apart\n- Shoot off limbs and slice off heads, then grab a severed arm and throw it\n- Walkers, Runners and hulking Brutes\n- Glowing ammo you can spot through walls\n- Health bar on your wrist, slow-mo multi-kills and combo chains\n\n", "short_description": "Shotgun Party is a mixed reality survival game. ZOMBIES have arrived. They are breaking through your real walls, doors and even the ground. Grab a shotgun off your shoulder, draw your sword, aim the canon, and blow the horde apart in your room. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://astrorockgames.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Astro Rock Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://astrorockgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1396682153532298"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"cou